Classification Recruitment Pre-employment Process Total Rewards Institutional Equity and Diversity Ethics and Compliance Policies, Forms, Contracts Calendar Schedule Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Announcements Human Resources Staff OneHR Customer Service Center Recruitment One of the ways Human Resources supports and enhances the University's mission is through our recruitment and selection efforts. Our institution strives to be a workplace of choice by attracting, developing, and retaining a highly qualified workforce where diversity and talent is valued. We ensure compliance with federal and state regulations and endeavor to develop policies which promote fair and equitable treatment for all. Please click here for information on completing the Form I-9 document verification process . Recruitment Processes Classified/Career Service Employees (Internal and External) Unclassified Employees Application Process Adjunct Faculty Pre-employment Process Faculty and Non-Teaching Professionals Advancement Graduate Assistants Lateral Transfers Student Employees Promotions Project Employee Skills Testing Temporary Agency Staffing Request Info Visit Apply Quick Links Employment Opportunities Campus Map Contact Us Get Connected Event Calendar WP News Give to William Paterson Social Media Directory WP Connect 300 Pompton Road | Wayne, New Jersey 07470 (973) 720-2000 Copyright © 2026 | Privacy Policy"
