      "description": "Dean of Students | William Paterson University In this Section Academics Admissions Campus Life About Us Athletics Cultural Events INFORMATION FOR Prospective Students Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Family Donors Alumni Our Local Community WP CONNECT MAPS & CONTACT GIVE APPLY Academics Academic Programs Program Search University Core Curriculum Course Offerings by Semester Register for Classes Undergraduate Catalog Graduate Catalog Online Degree Programs Alternate Credentials Student Research, Scholarship, and Creative Expression Academic Resources Academic Support Services Advisement Center Library Information Technology Blackboard Academic Calendar Career Development Internships Center for International Education Study Abroad Faculty & Staff Directory Colleges & Academic Units Colleges & Departments College of Adult and Professional Studies College of Arts, Humanities, and Social Sciences Cotsakos College of Business College of Education College of Science and Health WPUNJ at Mercer Honors College Special Programs Office of the Provost Admissions Undergraduate Admissions Apply Now Visit Campus Funding Your Education Discover the WP Experience Request Information Course Catalog My Application Status International Students Accepted Students School Counselors Parents & Family Contact Admissions Graduate Admissions About Us Graduate Academic Programs Apply Now My Application Status Admitted Students International Students Prospective Students Upcoming Events FAQ International Students Freshman Transfer Graduate Learn About WP Visit the Campus Take a Virtual Tour Experience WP Campus Life Activities Pioneer Life Portal Athletics Arts on Campus Campus Activities Civic Engagement Clubs & Organizations Club Sports Recreational Services Student Government Association (SGA) Weekly Calendar Housing & Dining Dining Services Hospitality Services Housing - Residence Life Transportation Commuter Services Transportation Services WP Shuttle Bus Schedules [pdf] Resources Division of Student Development Student Handbook (policies and resources) University Bookstore Other Departments Website Comments Equity & Inclusion Division of Equity and Inclusion Office for Student Diversity and Inclusion Services Accessibility Resource Center (Disability Services) Career Development Child Development Center Dean of Students Events and Conference Services Student Accounts (Bursar) Student Enrollment Services Veteran/Military Services Health & Safety University Police Rave Guardian Mobile App Counseling, Health, & Wellness Center Safe Walk Escort Service About Us What's Happening University News Events Calendar Arts on Campus Social Media Directory Community Child Development Center Civic Engagement Consumer Information Employment Opportunities Hispanic-Serving Institution Our Community University Police University Sustainability About WP All Departments University Facts Our History Our Background Mission, Vision, and Core Values Honors and Awards University Annual Report Student Achievements University Virtual Tour Our Alumni Giving to WP University Policies Open Public Records Request Strategic Plan Equity & Inclusion Division of Equity and Inclusion Office for Student Diversity and Inclusion Administration Board of Trustees Office of the President Provost and Academic Affairs Administration, Capital Planning, and Physical Plant Operations Enrollment Management Equity and Inclusion Finance and Controller General Counsel Human Resources Information Technology Institutional Advancement Marketing and Public Relations Strategic Initiatives and University Relations Student Development Athletics Cultural Events WP connect Maps & Contact Give Apply INFORMATION FOR Prospective Students Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Family Donors Alumni Our Local Community Student Development Student Development Home Mission Statement Student Development Leadership Team Departments Dean of Students Social Worker for Student Support & Resources Bias Prevention and Education Team Complaint/Incident Reporting Forms Resources for Faculty – FAQs Current Students Student Handbook Food Assistance Resources Public Safety Immigration Enforcement Related Campus Concerns FAQ Events and Conference Scheduling William Paterson University Student Memorial Dean of Students The Dean of Students is committed to helping students grow and develop personally, intellectually and professionally. Whether it is a time in your life when you are exploring something new or whether you are coping with an acute or chronic difficulty that may be getting in the way of your education, there are professional staff in our offices who can help you. Learning when and how to access available resources – either to enhance your educational efforts, or for help in overcoming obstacles to achieving your personal and professional goals – is an important part of student development and out-of-class learning.  We hope this is an essential part of the education you gain at William Paterson University.  Practicing that skill now, whether by arranging regular annual physicals, utilizing career development resources each year you are here, or utilizing any of our many campus resources, will better prepare you for life beyond college. If you are not s ure where to turn for help at William Paterson University, please contact me and I am happy to meet with you personally, or connect you with the right person to assist you.  All of us at William Paterson University look forward to helping you succeed in your educational efforts. Dr. Eileen Lubeck, Psy.D. Associate Vice President / Dean of Students Office: 973-720-2450 Email: Lubecke@wpunj.edu Request Info Visit Apply Quick Links Employment Opportunities Campus Map Contact Us Get Connected Event Calendar WP News Give to William Paterson Social Media Directory WP Connect 300 Pompton Road | Wayne, New Jersey 07470 (973) 720-2000 Copyright © 2026 | Privacy Policy"
    },
